---
// AboutUs Section - Historia y filosofía de In A Pickle
---

<section id="about" class="section bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-cream">
  <div class="container-custom">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        ABOUT US
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto text-center">
        A local solution for an active, social, year-round lifestyle
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Grid -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Main Story -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-soft p-8 md:p-12 mb-8">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-dark-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            In A Pickle was created by <strong class="text-primary">Rhode Islanders who live right here in North Providence</strong> and wanted more ways to stay active without having to travel far, rely on good weather, or commit to a traditional gym.
          </p>

          <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-dark-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Like a lot of people, we found ourselves saying the same things over and over: <em>There's nothing to do nearby. It's too cold, too hot, or raining again. We should probably get moving—but make it fun.</em> We wanted something social, indoors, and close to home. Something you could do after work, on a weekend, or just because you felt like getting out of the house.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-primary-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-r-lg p-6 my-8">
            <p class="text-lg text-primary-900 font-semibold italic">
              "That's where pickleball came in."
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-dark-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Pickleball is easy to learn, surprisingly competitive, and genuinely fun at every level. It's active without being intimidating, social without being forced, and it gives you a great workout without feeling like one. We realized it was exactly the kind of experience we were looking for—and exactly what our community was missing.
          </p>

          <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-dark-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            So we built In A Pickle: <strong class="text-primary">a single, private indoor pickleball court</strong> designed for quality play and a relaxed, welcoming experience. By focusing on one court, we're able to offer a more personal, comfortable, and exclusive environment—no overcrowding, no fighting for space, and no distractions.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mission Statement -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
        
        <!-- Our Goal -->
        <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">Our Goal</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            To give people in and around North Providence a place to move their bodies, connect with friends, and do something fun year-round, all without going far.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Promise -->
        <div class="bg-accent text-dark rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-dark/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">Our Promise</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-dark-800 leading-relaxed">
            Whether you're booking an hour with friends, joining as a member, or trying pickleball for the first time, In A Pickle is meant to feel easy, local, and inviting.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Closing Statement -->
      <div class="bg-cream-100 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 text-center border-2 border-primary-100">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-4">
          "We built this because it's what we wanted—and we're excited to share it with the community we call home."
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center space-x-2 text-dark-600">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="font-semibold">Proudly serving North Providence, RI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Why Pickleball? Mini Section -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16">
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-center text-primary mb-8">
        Why Pickleball?
      </h3>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2">Easy to Learn</h4>
          <p class="text-dark-600 text-sm">
            Pick it up in minutes, perfect it over time. All skill levels welcome.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2">Social & Fun</h4>
          <p class="text-dark-600 text-sm">
            Great for friends, family, or making new connections while staying active.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2">Great Workout</h4>
          <p class="text-dark-600 text-sm">
            Low-impact cardio that doesn't feel like a chore. Stay fit while having fun.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>